  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the punk becomes a legend of the streets in his own right. No one, from the lowest street beggar to the highest king can hold him back. He gains the ability to act as if he was constantly under the effects of freedom of movement, and when attacking a creature of the lawful alignment with his gravity gain class feature, he always is considered to have fallen from at least 100 feet.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-punk#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
